FlexRIC 736508123fe4b5dc3db83fb5baf5f0a8e9b04fe8.
Apply 73650812-kpm-timestamp.patch first.
This cumulative patch REPLACES 73650812-pusch-rsrp.patch; do not apply both.
Adds DU PUSCH RSRP/dBFS and SNR/dB display using the original scheduler label.
The original SNR field retains its existing ul_sinr_dB measurement source.
RSRQ n/a notices are local xApp capability status, not E2 measurements.
Use configs/flexric/xapp_du_rf_metrics.conf; the DU must expose both metrics.
header_time_us is the KPM header time, not the PHY measurement time.

